1
00:00:00,592 --> 00:00:02,962
(Amy:)Maybe next week we could all get together.

2
00:00:03,128 --> 00:00:05,188
(Raj:)Lucy, you don't have to answer that.

3
00:00:05,363 --> 00:00:07,953
(Raj:)Don't put her on the spot,
she hates that. Am I right?

4
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:11,533
(Raj:)Tell her how much you hate being
put on the spot. Go ahead, tell her.

5
00:00:11,703 --> 00:00:12,793
(Amy:)He's a little nervous...

6
00:00:12,971 --> 00:00:16,531
...because he doesn't think I understand
the severity of your social anxiety.

7
00:00:16,708 --> 00:00:20,408
(Raj:)You can't talk about social anxiety
to someone who has social anxiety...

8
00:00:20,579 --> 00:00:23,049
(Raj:)...it makes them socially anxious.

9
00:00:23,648 --> 00:00:27,278
(Amy:)Excuse me, but I'm a neurobiologist,
I think I'm more qualified than you...

10
00:00:27,452 --> 00:00:30,422
(Amy:)...to understand what's not working
in your girlfriend's brain.

11
00:00:31,356 --> 00:00:32,756
(Raj:)Don't call her my girlfriend.

12
00:00:32,924 --> 00:00:35,954
(Raj:)We haven't discussed whether
we're girlfriend and boyfriend yet.

13
00:00:36,795 --> 00:00:38,785
(Raj:)Now that it's out there...

14
00:00:40,966 --> 00:00:45,296
(Raj:)...are you my girlfriend? By the way,
if you say no, I'll never be happy again.

15
00:00:46,638 --> 00:00:48,298
(Raj:)Not to put you on the spot.

16
00:00:50,809 --> 00:00:53,369
(Lucy:)I think I have to go to the bathroom.

17
00:00:57,048 --> 00:01:06,028
(Raj:)We might as well go ahead and eat.
She's not coming back any time soon.

